  "description": "In Waves is the second studio album by English producer Jamie xx, released on 20 September 2024 through Young. It was preceded by the singles \"Baddy on the Floor\" featuring Honey Dijon and \"Treat Each Other Right\", and is his first album in nine years, following In Colour (2015). The album also includes collaborations with Jamie xx's xx bandmates Romy and Oliver Sim, as well as Honey Dijon, Kelsey Lu, John Glacier, Panda Bear, Robyn, the Avalanches, and Oona Doherty. An additional collaboration with Erykah Badu features on the deluxe vinyl, later made available on streaming platforms.",
